  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1102.52 Resident project representative",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1102.52 “Resident project representative” means an individual who:\n\n(a) Is qualified by reason of education and experience to inspect infrastructure projects; and\n\n(b) Reports to a licensed professional engineer when the project’s plan and scope of work indicate supervision by an engineer is required.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 1100) #13160, eff 1-20-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1100.html"
